# (d) Prospector gift, then a return interdiction solved without a burn.
# Keep the tank full outbound by dumping cargo; at the station give 200 L:
# 650 - 200 = 450, the return leg burns 350, leaving 100 L at the return
# interdiction: enough to land, not enough for a 150 L Overclock Burn.
seed 4
orders caretaker
run-to 10
split cal,jonathan,dax
close
launch
fly dump
expect fuel 650
expect crates 7
expect delay 0
close
# Not built yet from here (docking: milestone 7).
dock
haggle carbon-filters
give-fuel 200
expect fuel 450
return
screenshot return-hazard        # overclock must show as unavailable
resolve bluff
land
expect fuel 100
screenshot blackbox
